    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.mp4?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced auto battler where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies and objects. Explore the diverse biomes of <strong>Cosmic Park Swirlstone</strong> and restore <strong>Camp Cloudburst</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors\u2014from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>6 different characters</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Customize your character with a specialized ranger gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect 50+ unique plushies</i></strong> - Each plushie has a different ability.\u00a0 Level them up to discover new synergies between your plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Achieve 150+ badges</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Each badge unlocks additional content, challenges, or improved capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Discover 75+ relic artifacts</strong> -</i> Relics provide bonuses and abilities during your run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=801 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.mp4?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced auto battler where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies and objects. Explore the diverse biomes of <strong>Cosmic Park Swirlstone</strong> and restore <strong>Camp Cloudburst</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors\u2014from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>6 different characters</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Customize your character with a specialized ranger gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect 50+ unique plushies</i></strong> - Each plushie has a different ability.\u00a0 Level them up to discover new synergies between your plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Achieve 150+ badges</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Each badge unlocks additional content, challenges, or improved capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Discover 75+ relic artifacts</strong> -</i> Relics provide bonuses and abilities during your run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=801 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Assemble your team of adorable Plushie friends and lead them against hordes of mutated constructs in this fast paced auto-battler/Survivors-like. Collect relics, earn merit badges, discover secrets, rescue friends and take out the trash. Can you defeat the growing menace of the evil Mother Ducker?",
